{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloven Blade is an action-heavy platforming adventure featuring a small clan of hoofed ninja apprentices fighting to reclaim their once peaceful homeland from reptilian foes. <br><br>Master fluid combat, discover new abilities, rescue adorable creatures and uncover the ancient secrets of the Way of Hoof in a family-friendly action adventure bursting with charm and challenge!<br><br><br><strong>Fluid Combat &amp; Movement</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fast, agile martial arts, acrobatic platforming, and versatile ninja gadgets. Easy-to-learn controls with layered depth for players to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a world filled with danger, secrets, and optional challenges. Uncover hidden paths, earn rewards, and grow your skills as a Hoof clan warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic Book Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold visuals, dramatic panels, and over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604250?t=1748961823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604250?t=1748961823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604250/8af8071b14847761c96285ad6435065b7973db30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748961823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604250/8af8071b14847761c96285ad6435065b7973db30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748961823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloven Blade is an action-heavy platforming adventure featuring a sm